index a4f48b5..fb36d0b 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/webhooks.md
@@ -159,3 +159,9 @@ __Response:__
 ```
 
 `request` and `response` can be `null` for deliveries that have not started yet or are still in progress. The delivery request headers omit the `X-Webhook-Signature` header.
+
+## Delivery behavior
+
+When a subscribed event occurs, Fizzy sends one JSON `POST` to the webhook payload URL. The request includes `X-Webhook-Timestamp` and `X-Webhook-Signature` headers. Generate the SHA-256 HMAC of the request body with the webhook signing secret to verify the signature.
+
+A 2xx response is a successful delivery. HTTP errors and unreachable destinations are logged as failures. A webhook is deactivated after ten consecutive failures that occur within one hour. Delivery history is retained for seven days.
